{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19597","headline":"立春日晓望三素云 · 陈师穆","name":"立春日晓望三素云","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晴晓初春日，高心望素云。\n彩光浮玉辇，紫气隐元君。\n缥缈中天去，逍遥上界分。\n鸾骖攀不及，仙吹远难闻。\n礼候於斯覩，明循在解纷。\n人归悬想处，霞色自氛氲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈师穆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19597.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19597","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}